<title>UK: SOCCER-KILMARNOCK AND DUNDEE UNITED DRAW SCOTTISH CUP SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KILMARNOCK AND DUNDEE UNITED DRAW SCOTTISH CUP SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Scottish Cup</p>
<p>semifinal played at Easter Road on Monday:</p>
<p> Kilmarnock	0	 Dundee United	0</p>
<p>Eventual winner plays Celtic or Falkirk in the final in</p>
<p>Glasgow on May 24.</p>
</text>
